{{!--
  The body of the valuation report — everything after the covering letter and
  the photograph annexure, printed as one document so Chrome can number its
  pages and repeat the slim header/footer across them.

  Section order and clause numbering follow the reference report the firm
  issues today (I. General, II. Characteristics of Site, the Valuation and
  Certificate, Format-E, then Annexure-01 with Parts A-G and the circle-rate
  extract), so a bank reading it side by side with an older report finds the
  same clause under the same number.
--}}
{{> report-styles}}
<style>
  .title-block {
    margin-bottom: 4mm;
    padding-bottom: 2.5mm;
    border-bottom: 1.6pt solid var(--navy);
  }
  .title-block h1 {
    margin: 0 0 1mm;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-size: 10.5pt;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .6px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .title-block .valuer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 6mm;
    font-size: 7pt;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .title-block .valuer b { color: var(--navy); }

  h2.part {
    margin: 6mm 0 2mm;
    padding-bottom: 1.2mm;
    border-bottom: 1pt solid var(--gold);
    color: var(--navy);
    font-size: 8.4pt;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    break-after: avoid;
    page-break-after: avoid;
  }

  /* The clause tables carry their own numbering gutter, so the generic
     label column is narrower here than the shared default. */
  table.clauses td.label { width: 42%; }
</style>

<div class="title-block">
  <h1>Valuation Report</h1>
  <div class="valuer">
    <span>Registered Valuer: <b>{{valuer.name}}</b></span>
    <span>Registration No.: <b>{{valuer.registrationNo}}</b></span>
    <span>Report No.: <b>{{or reportNo "—"}}</b></span>
  </div>
</div>

{{!-- ===================== I. GENERAL ===================== --}}
<h2 class="part">I &nbsp; General</h2>
<table class="clauses">
  <tr><td class="sn">1</td><td class="label">Purpose for which the valuation is made</td>
      <td>To assess the fair market value of the property</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">2 a.</td><td class="label">Date of inspection</td>
      <td>{{dateLong siteVisitDate}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">b.</td><td class="label">Date of making the valuation</td>
      <td>{{dateLong valuationDate}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">3 a.</td><td class="label">List of documents produced</td>
      <td>{{or documentsReceivedText "Title Deed, LSR &amp; Building Plan"}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">b.</td>
      <td class="label">Survey no. and Registrar Office wherein the title deeds are registered</td>
      <td>Bahi No. {{or titleDeed.bahiNo "—"}}, Jild No. {{or titleDeed.jildNo "—"}},
          Serial No. {{or titleDeed.deedNo "—"}}{{#if titleDeed.purchaseDate}},
          dated {{date titleDeed.purchaseDate}}{{/if}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">4 a.</td><td class="label">Name of the owner/s</td>
      <td><strong>{{or titleDeed.ownerName "N.A."}}</strong></td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">b.</td><td class="label">Contact person</td>
      <td>{{or titleDeed.contactPerson "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">c.</td><td class="label">Phone no.</td>
      <td>{{or titleDeed.contactPhone "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">d.</td>
      <td class="label">If the property is under joint ownership / co-ownership, share of each
          such owner. Are the shares undivided?</td>
      <td>{{or titleDeed.ownershipType "N.A."}}{{#if titleDeed.sharesDivided}} —
          {{titleDeed.sharesDivided}}{{/if}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">e.</td><td class="label">Is the property Freehold or Leasehold</td>
      <td>{{or tenure "Freehold"}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">f.</td>
      <td class="label">If leasehold, name of lessee &amp; lessor, date of commencement and
          period of lease</td>
      <td>
        {{#if leaseDetails}}
          Lessor: {{or leaseDetails.lessor "N.A."}}; Lessee: {{or leaseDetails.lessee "N.A."}};
          Commencing {{or leaseDetails.dateOfCommencement "N.A."}};
          Period {{or leaseDetails.periodOfLease "N.A."}};
          Ground rent p.a. {{or leaseDetails.groundRent "N.A."}}
        {{else}}N.A.{{/if}}
      </td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">5</td><td class="label">Brief description of the property</td>
      <td>{{or briefDescription "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">6</td><td class="label">Location of property — Property number / Flat no.</td>
      <td>{{or siteAddress.propertyNumber "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn"></td><td class="label">Colony / Locality</td>
      <td>{{or siteAddress.colony "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn"></td><td class="label">Ward / Tehsil for registration</td>
      <td>{{or siteAddress.wardTehsilRegistration "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn"></td><td class="label">City</td>
      <td>{{or siteAddress.cityVillageTown "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr class="total"><td class="sn">7</td><td>Postal address of the property</td>
      <td>{{or consolidatedSiteAddress "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn"></td><td class="label">Address of the property as mentioned in the deed</td>
      <td>{{or titleDeed.addressAsPerDeed "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">8 a.</td><td class="label">City / Town / Village</td>
      <td>{{or general.cityTownVillage "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">b.</td>
      <td class="label">Is the property situated in a Residential / Commercial / Mixed /
          Industrial area</td>
      <td>{{or general.approvedLandUse "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">9</td><td class="label">Classification of locality — High / Middle / Poor class</td>
      <td>{{or general.classOfLocality "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn"></td><td class="label">Urban / Semi-urban / Rural</td>
      <td>{{or general.urbanSemiUrbanRural "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">10</td>
      <td class="label">Coming under Corporation limit / Village Panchayat / Municipality</td>
      <td>{{or general.corporationLimit "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">11</td>
      <td class="label">Whether covered under any State / Central Govt. enactments (e.g. Urban
          Land Ceiling Act) or notified under agency / schedule / cantonment area</td>
      <td>{{or general.govtEnactments "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">12</td>
      <td class="label">In case it is agricultural land, is any conversion to house-site plots
          contemplated</td>
      <td>{{or general.agriculturalConversion "N.A."}}</td></tr>
</table>

<h3 class="sub">13 &nbsp; Boundaries of the Property</h3>
<table>
  <tr>
    <th style="width:14%">Direction</th>
    <th>As per Documents</th>
    <th>As per Actual (Site)</th>
  </tr>
  {{#each boundaryRows}}
  <tr>
    <td><strong>{{this.direction}}</strong></td>
    <td>{{or this.asPerDocs "—"}}</td>
    <td>{{or this.asPerSite "—"}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{/each}}
</table>
<table class="clauses">
  <tr><td class="sn">13.1</td>
      <td class="label">Whether the land is demarcated; is a compound wall with gate available</td>
      <td>{{or discrepancy.plotDemarcated "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">13.2</td><td class="label">Plot no. or house no. allocated</td>
      <td>{{or siteAddress.propertyNumber "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">13.3</td>
      <td class="label">Whether the boundary is matching; reason for deviation</td>
      <td>{{or discrepancy.boundariesMatching "N.A."}}{{#if discrepancy.mismatchReason}} —
          {{discrepancy.mismatchReason}}{{/if}}</td></tr>
</table>

<h3 class="sub">14 &nbsp; Dimensions of the Site</h3>
<table class="dims">
  <tr>
    <th style="width:14%">Direction</th>
    <th class="center">(14a) As per Documents</th>
    <th class="center">(14b) As per Site</th>
    <th class="center" style="width:14%">Unit</th>
  </tr>
  {{#each boundaryRows}}
  <tr>
    <td><strong>{{this.direction}}</strong></td>
    <td class="num">{{or this.dimDocs "—"}}</td>
    <td class="num">{{or this.dimSite "—"}}</td>
    <td class="center">{{../dimensionUnit}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{/each}}
  <tr class="total">
    <td>Area</td>
    <td class="num">{{#if areaAsPerDeed}}{{num areaAsPerDeed}}{{else}}—{{/if}}</td>
    <td class="num">{{#if areaAsPerSite}}{{num areaAsPerSite}}{{else}}—{{/if}}</td>
    <td class="center">{{or areaUnit "Sq.m"}}</td>
  </tr>
</table>
<table class="clauses">
  <tr><td class="sn">14.1</td><td class="label">Latitude, longitude &amp; co-ordinates of the site</td>
      <td>{{or gpsCoordinates "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  {{!-- Prints the same figure as clause 16: the area actually carried into the
        valuation, not a raw re-derivation from the site dimensions above —
        the two should never disagree on the page. --}}
  <tr><td class="sn">15</td><td class="label">Extent of the site</td>
      <td>{{num plotAreaSqM}} Sq.m</td></tr>
  <tr class="total"><td class="sn">16</td>
      <td>Extent of the site considered for valuation (least of 14a &amp; 14b)</td>
      <td class="num">{{num plotAreaSqM}} Sq.m</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">17</td><td class="label">Is the property owner-occupied / tenanted / both</td>
      <td>{{or general.occupancyStatus "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">a.</td><td class="label">Names of tenants / lessees / licensees</td>
      <td>{{or general.tenantNames "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">b.</td><td class="label">Portion in their occupation</td>
      <td>{{or general.portionUnderOccupation "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">c.</td>
      <td class="label">Monthly or annual rent / compensation / licence fee paid by each</td>
      <td>{{or general.rentPaid "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">17.1</td>
      <td class="label">Whether up-to-date taxes are paid; mention the latest tax receipt number</td>
      <td>{{or general.propertyTaxPaid "N.A."}}{{#if general.taxReceiptNumberDate}} —
          {{general.taxReceiptNumberDate}}{{/if}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">18</td>
      <td class="label">Is the construction plan approved by the competent authority</td>
      <td>{{or general.approvingAuthority "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  {{!-- Before this field existed valuers typed the plan number into
        "Is building plan approved", so that is the fallback. --}}
  <tr><td class="sn"></td><td class="label">Approval no.</td>
      <td>{{or general.buildingPlanApprovalNo general.buildingPlanApproved}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn"></td><td class="label">Is the construction as per the approved layout?</td>
      <td>{{or general.constructionAsPerLayout "N.A."}}</td></tr>
</table>

{{!-- ============= II. CHARACTERISTICS OF SITE ============= --}}
<h2 class="part">II &nbsp; Characteristics of the Site</h2>
<table class="clauses">
  <tr><td class="sn">1</td><td class="label">Classification of locality</td>
      <td>{{or general.classOfLocality "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">2</td><td class="label">Development of the surrounding area</td>
      <td>{{or general.developmentOfArea "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">3</td><td class="label">Whether the locality is subject to frequent flooding</td>
      <td>{{or general.floodingProne "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">4</td>
      <td class="label">Feasibility to civic amenities like school, hospital, bus stop, market etc.</td>
      <td>{{or general.proximityToAmenities "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">5</td><td class="label">Level of land with topographical conditions</td>
      <td>{{or general.levelOfLand "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">6</td><td class="label">Shape of the plot</td>
      <td>{{or general.plotShape "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">7</td><td class="label">Equivalent spent life</td>
      <td>{{#if spentLifeYears}}{{spentLifeYears}} Yrs{{else}}N.A.{{/if}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">8</td><td class="label">Residual age</td>
      <td>{{#if residualAgeYears}}{{residualAgeYears}} Yrs{{else}}N.A.{{/if}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">9</td><td class="label">Type of use to which it can be put</td>
      <td>{{or general.purposeOfUse "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">10</td><td class="label">Any usage restriction</td>
      <td>{{or general.restrictiveCovenant "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">11</td><td class="label">Is the plot in a town-planning approved layout</td>
      <td>{{or general.approvedColony "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">12</td><td class="label">Corner plot or intermittent plot</td>
      <td>{{or land.plotPosition "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">13</td><td class="label">Road facilities</td>
      <td>{{or general.roadFacilities "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">14</td><td class="label">Type of road available at present</td>
      <td>{{or buildingSpecs.typeOfRoad "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">15</td><td class="label">Width of road — is it below 20 ft or more</td>
      <td>{{or buildingSpecs.widthOfRoad "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">16</td><td class="label">Is it a land-locked land?</td>
      <td>{{or discrepancy.landLocked "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">17</td><td class="label">Water potentiality</td>
      <td>{{or buildingSpecs.waterSupply "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">18</td><td class="label">Underground sewerage system</td>
      <td>{{or buildingSpecs.sewerage "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">19</td><td class="label">Is power supply available at the site</td>
      <td>{{or general.powerSupply "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">20</td><td class="label">Advantages / disadvantages of the site</td>
      <td>Positive: {{or general.positiveFactors "None"}}; Negative:
          {{or general.negativeFactors "None"}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">21</td>
      <td class="label">Special remarks, if any, like threat of acquisition of land for public
          service purposes, road widening or applicability of CRZ provisions</td>
      <td>{{or general.noticedForAcquisition "None"}}{{#if general.landAcquisitionRoadWidening}} —
          {{general.landAcquisitionRoadWidening}}{{/if}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">21.1</td>
      <td class="label">Specific comment about the property if it belongs to a Waqf / Temple Trust</td>
      <td>{{or general.waqfOrTrustProperty "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">21.2</td>
      <td class="label">Specific comment if the property is near a highway, under an HT line, or
          adjoins a railway track or cemetery</td>
      <td>{{or general.proximityToHazards "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">21.3</td>
      <td class="label">Is the land swampy, marshy, reclaimed or garden land</td>
      <td>{{or general.landCondition "N.A."}}</td></tr>
</table>

<h3 class="sub">22 &nbsp; Guideline Value / Value of the IP as per Circle Rates</h3>
<table>
  <tr><td class="label">Construction value</td>
      <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr computed.guideline.constructionValue}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Land value</td>
      <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr computed.guideline.landValue}}</td></tr>
  <tr class="total"><td>Value as per Govt. guideline rates</td>
      <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr computed.guideline.totalValue}}</td></tr>
</table>

<table>
  <tr class="grand"><td>23 &nbsp; Market value of the property</td>
      <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr computed.roundedValue}}</td></tr>
  <tr class="total"><td>24 &nbsp; Realizable sale value of the property</td>
      <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr computed.realizableValue}}</td></tr>
  <tr class="total"><td>25 &nbsp; Forced sale value of the property</td>
      <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr computed.distressValue}}</td></tr>
</table>

{{!-- ===================== VALUATION ===================== --}}
<div class="page-break"></div>
<h2 class="part">Valuation</h2>

<p class="prose">
  To assess the value of the property I have adopted the <strong>{{methodLabel}}</strong>, which is
  appropriate for the valuation of such properties.
</p>
<p class="prose">
  As a result of my appraisal and analysis, it is my considered opinion that the market value of the
  above property in the prevailing condition, with the aforesaid specifications, is as follows:
</p>

<table class="keep">
  <tr class="grand">
    <td>Market Value</td>
    <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr computed.roundedValue}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td colspan="2" class="words">{{marketValueInWords}}</td></tr>
  <tr class="total">
    <td>Realizable Sale Value <span class="muted">(10% less than the market value)</span></td>
    <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr computed.realizableValue}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td colspan="2" class="words">{{realizableValueInWords}}</td></tr>
  <tr class="total">
    <td>Distress / Forced Sale Value <span class="muted">(20% less than the market value)</span></td>
    <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr computed.distressValue}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td colspan="2" class="words">{{distressValueInWords}}</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Insurable value of the building</td>
    <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr computed.insurableValue}}</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<h3 class="sub">Certificate</h3>
<ol class="clauses">
  <li>
    It is hereby certified that in my opinion:
    <ol class="clauses" type="i">
      <li>
        The present market value of the property discussed in this report, adopting the prevailing
        market rate for land, is of the order of <strong>&#8377; {{inr computed.roundedValue}}</strong>
        ({{marketValueInWords}}).
      </li>
      <li>The forced sale value of the property is estimated as 20% less than the present market value.</li>
      <li>The realisable value of the property is estimated as 10% less than the present market value.</li>
    </ol>
  </li>
  <li>
    Number of title deed(s) involved in this property is {{or titleDeed.numberOfTitleDeeds "1"}} nos.
    The relevant document for the subject property in the opinion of this valuer is
    {{or titleDeed.relevantDocument "the photocopy of the Site Plan Map"}}.
  </li>
  <li>
    If this property is offered as collateral security, the concerned financial institution is
    requested to verify the extent of land shown in this valuation report with respect to the latest
    legal opinion.
  </li>
  <li>
    Value varies with the purpose and date of valuation. This report is not to be referred to if the
    purpose is different from the one mentioned in (1).
  </li>
  <li>The property was inspected on {{date siteVisitDate}} by {{valuer.name}}.</li>
  <li>The legal aspects were not considered in this valuation.</li>
  <li>
    This valuation work was / has been undertaken by the valuer based upon the request from
    {{institution.name}}{{#if branch.branchName}}, {{branch.branchName}}{{/if}}.
  </li>
</ol>

<div class="sign-off keep">
  <div class="place">
    Place: {{or place "Agra"}}<br />
    Date: {{dateLong valuationDate}}
  </div>
  <div class="who">
    <strong>{{valuer.name}}</strong>
    <span>{{valuer.credentials}}</span>
  </div>
</div>

{{!-- ===================== FORMAT-E ===================== --}}
<div class="page-break"></div>
<h2 class="part">Format-E &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Declaration from Valuers</h2>

<ol class="clauses" type="a">
  <li>I am a citizen of India.</li>
  <li>
    The information furnished in my valuation report is true and correct to the best of my knowledge
    and belief, and I have made an impartial and true valuation of the property.
  </li>
  <li>I have no direct or indirect interest in the property valued.</li>
  <li>
    I have personally inspected the property on {{dateLong siteVisitDate}}. The work is not
