          responsibility for the valuation report</td>
      <td>{{or general.negativeFactors "None"}}</td></tr>
</table>

<div class="sign-off keep">
  <div class="place">
    Place: {{or place "Agra"}}<br />
    Date: {{dateLong valuationDate}}
  </div>
  <div class="who">
    <strong>{{valuer.name}}</strong>
    <span>{{valuer.credentials}}</span>
  </div>
</div>

{{!-- ================= ANNEXURE-01 · PART A ================= --}}
<div class="page-break"></div>
<h2 class="part">Annexure-01 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Valuation of the Property</h2>

<h3 class="band">Part A &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Valuation of Land</h3>
<h3 class="sub">1 &nbsp; Size of the plot</h3>
<table class="dims">
  <tr>
    <th style="width:14%">Direction</th>
    <th class="center">As per Documents</th>
    <th class="center">As per Site</th>
    <th class="center" style="width:14%">Unit</th>
  </tr>
  {{#each boundaryRows}}
  <tr>
    <td><strong>{{this.direction}}</strong></td>
    <td class="num">{{or this.dimDocs "—"}}</td>
    <td class="num">{{or this.dimSite "—"}}</td>
    <td class="center">{{../dimensionUnit}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{/each}}
  <tr class="total">
    <td>Area</td>
    <td class="num">{{#if areaAsPerDeed}}{{num areaAsPerDeed}}{{else}}—{{/if}}</td>
    <td class="num">{{#if areaAsPerSite}}{{num areaAsPerSite}}{{else}}—{{/if}}</td>
    <td class="center">{{or areaUnit "Sq.m"}}</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<table class="clauses">
  <tr><td class="sn"></td><td class="label">Variations from the title deed, if any</td>
      <td>{{or discrepancy.mismatchReason "None"}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">2</td><td class="label">Total extent of the plot</td>
      <td class="num">{{num plotAreaSqM}} Sq.m</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn"></td><td class="label">Area under consideration (basis)</td>
      <td>{{or areaBasis "Plot Area"}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn"></td><td class="label">Undivided share of land</td>
      <td>{{or undividedShare.label "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">3</td><td class="label">Prevailing market rate</td>
      <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr land.prevailingMarketRate}} (+/-10%) / Sq.m</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">4</td><td class="label">Guideline rate (circle rate)</td>
      <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr land.circleRate}} / Sq.m</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">5</td><td class="label">Unit rate adopted in this valuation</td>
      <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr land.adoptedRate}} / Sq.m</td></tr>
  <tr class="total"><td class="sn">6</td><td>Estimated value of land</td>
      <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr computed.partA}}</td></tr>
</table>

<h3 class="band">Part B &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Building Component</h3>
<table class="clauses">
  <tr><td class="sn"></td><td class="label">Type of building (Residential / Commercial / Industrial)</td>
      <td>{{or general.approvedLandUse "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">1</td><td class="label">Type of construction (structure)</td>
      <td>{{or buildingSpecs.typeOfConstruction "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">2</td><td class="label">Quality of construction</td>
      <td>{{or buildingSpecs.quality "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">3</td><td class="label">Appearance of the building</td>
      <td>{{or buildingSpecs.appearance "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">4</td><td class="label">Maintenance / condition of the building</td>
      <td>{{or buildingSpecs.maintenance "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">i.</td><td class="label">Exterior (New / Excellent / Good / Normal / Average / Poor)</td>
      <td>{{or buildingSpecs.exterior "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">ii.</td><td class="label">Interior (Excellent / Good / Normal / Average / Poor)</td>
      <td>{{or buildingSpecs.interior "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">5</td><td class="label">Plinth / covered areas</td>
      <td>As per IS 3861-1975</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn"></td><td class="label">Type of foundation</td>
      <td>{{or buildingSpecs.foundation "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn"></td><td class="label">Stage of construction</td>
      <td>{{or buildingSpecs.stage "N.A."}}</td></tr>
</table>

<h3 class="sub">6 &nbsp; No. of floors{{#if floorDetails.totalFloors}} &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;
  {{floorDetails.totalFloors}}{{/if}}</h3>
<table>
  <tr>
    <th class="sn">S. No.</th><th>Floor</th>
    <th class="center">Year of Construction</th>
    <th class="num">Covered Area</th>
    <th class="center" style="width:14%">Unit</th>
  </tr>
  {{#each computed.floors}}
  <tr>
    <td class="sn">{{inc @index}}</td>
    <td>{{this.name}}</td>
    <td class="center">{{or this.yearOfConstruction "—"}}</td>
    <td class="num">{{num this.coveredAreaSqM}}</td>
    <td class="center">Sq.m</td>
  </tr>
  {{/each}}
  {{#if actualCoveredAreaSqM}}
  <tr class="total"><td class="sn"></td><td colspan="2">Actual covered area</td>
      <td class="num">{{num actualCoveredAreaSqM}}</td><td class="center">Sq.m</td></tr>
  {{/if}}
  <tr class="total"><td class="sn"></td><td colspan="2">Area considered for valuation</td>
      <td class="num">{{num consideredCoveredAreaSqM}}</td><td class="center">Sq.m</td></tr>
</table>

<h3 class="sub">7 &nbsp; Drawing approval</h3>
<table class="clauses">
  <tr><td class="sn">a.</td><td class="label">Date of issue and validity of the approved map / plan</td>
      <td>{{or general.buildingPlanApprovalNo general.buildingPlanApproved}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">b.</td><td class="label">Approved map / plan issuing authority</td>
      <td>{{or general.approvingAuthority "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">c.</td>
      <td class="label">Whether the genuineness or authenticity of the approved map / plan is verified</td>
      <td>{{or general.planAuthenticityVerified "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">d.</td><td class="label">Any other comments by the valuer on the authenticity of the approved plan</td>
      <td>{{or general.natureOfViolations "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">e.</td>
      <td class="label">Whether the building is constructed as per the approved plan; details of deviation, if any</td>
      <td>{{or general.constructionAsPerLayout "N.A."}}</td></tr>
</table>

{{!-- ============ SPECIFICATIONS & FLOORWISE VALUATION ============ --}}
{{#if floorSpecRows}}
<div class="page-break"></div>
<h3 class="sub">8 &nbsp; Specification of construction (floorwise)</h3>
<table>
  {{#each floorSpecRows}}
  <tr>
    {{#if this.header}}
      <th style="width:34%">{{this.label}}</th>
      {{#each this.values}}<th class="center">{{this}}</th>{{/each}}
    {{else}}
      <td class="label" style="width:34%">{{this.label}}</td>
      {{#each this.values}}<td>{{this}}</td>{{/each}}
    {{/if}}
  </tr>
  {{/each}}
</table>
{{else}}
<div class="page-break"></div>
{{/if}}

<h3 class="band">Floorwise Valuation of the Covered Area</h3>
<table>
  <tr>
    <th style="width:34%">Particulars</th>
    {{#each computed.floors}}<th class="center">{{this.name}}</th>{{/each}}
  </tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Total plinth area (Sq.m)</td>
      {{#each computed.floors}}<td class="num">{{num this.coveredAreaSqM}}</td>{{/each}}</tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Height of floor</td>
      {{#each floorHeights}}<td class="num">{{or this "N.A."}}</td>{{/each}}</tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Year of construction</td>
      {{#each computed.floors}}<td class="num">{{this.yearOfConstruction}}</td>{{/each}}</tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Equivalent spent life</td>
      {{#each computed.floors}}<td class="num">{{this.age}} Yrs</td>{{/each}}</tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Residual age</td>
      {{#each computed.floors}}<td class="num">{{this.residualAge}} Yrs</td>{{/each}}</tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Total estimated life</td>
      {{#each computed.floors}}<td class="num">{{this.expectedLifeYears}} Yrs</td>{{/each}}</tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Depreciation percentage [salvage value as 10%]</td>
      {{#each computed.floors}}<td class="num">{{pct this.depreciationPercent}}</td>{{/each}}</tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Replacement rate of construction with existing conditions &amp;
      specifications (per Sq.m)</td>
      {{#each computed.floors}}<td class="num">&#8377; {{inr this.replacementRate}}</td>{{/each}}</tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Replacement value</td>
      {{#each computed.floors}}<td class="num">&#8377; {{inr this.replacementValue}}</td>{{/each}}</tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Depreciation</td>
      {{#each computed.floors}}<td class="num">&#8377; {{inr this.depreciation}}</td>{{/each}}</tr>
  <tr class="total"><td>Depreciated value</td>
      {{#each computed.floors}}<td class="num">&#8377; {{inr this.depreciatedValue}}</td>{{/each}}</tr>
</table>
<div class="note">
  Depreciation is computed on a 90% depreciable base, taking the salvage value as 10% of cost.
</div>

<h3 class="band">Part C &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Extra Items (after depreciation)</h3>
{{#if extraItemRows.length}}
<table>
  {{#each extraItemRows}}
  <tr><td class="label">{{this.label}}</td><td class="num">{{this.value}}</td></tr>
  {{/each}}
  <tr class="total"><td>Total — extra items</td>
      <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr computed.extraItemsValue}}</td></tr>
</table>
{{else}}
<p class="prose callout">Considered in the covered area rates.</p>
{{/if}}

<h3 class="band">Part D &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Amenities</h3>
<p class="prose callout">{{or amenitiesNote "None"}}</p>

<h3 class="band">Part E &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Miscellaneous</h3>
<p class="prose callout">{{or miscellaneousNote "None"}}</p>

<h3 class="band">Part F &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Value of Services (after depreciation)</h3>
{{#if serviceRows.length}}
<table>
  {{#each serviceRows}}
  <tr><td class="label">{{this.label}}</td><td>{{this.value}}</td></tr>
  {{/each}}
</table>
{{else}}
<table>
  <tr><td class="label">Water supply arrangement</td><td>Considered in the covered area rates</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Drainage arrangement</td><td>Considered in the covered area rates</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Electric supply fittings</td><td>Considered in the covered area rates</td></tr>
</table>
{{/if}}

<h3 class="band">Part G &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Abstract</h3>
<table class="keep">
  <tr><td class="sn">1</td><td class="label">Part A — Land</td>
      <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr computed.partA}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">2</td>
      <td class="label">Parts B, C, D &amp; E — Building, amenities &amp; extra items</td>
      <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr computed.partBtoE}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="sn">3</td><td class="label">Part F — Services</td>
      <td>Considered in the covered area rates</td></tr>
  <tr class="total"><td class="sn"></td><td>Present worth</td>
      <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr computed.totalValue}}</td></tr>
  <tr class="grand"><td class="sn"></td><td>Say</td>
      <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr computed.roundedValue}}</td></tr>
</table>

{{#if remarks}}
<h3 class="sub">Remarks</h3>
<p class="prose callout">{{remarks}}</p>
{{/if}}

{{!-- ============ APPLICABLE GOVT. GUIDELINE RATES ============ --}}
<div class="page-break"></div>
<h2 class="part">Applicable Govt. Guideline Rates (Circle Rates)</h2>

<table>
  <tr><td class="label">Sub-registrar office / Tehsil</td>
      <td>{{or siteAddress.tehsilForCircleRates "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Local body / Mohalla</td>
      <td>{{or siteAddress.mohalla "N.A."}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Road width band</td>
      <td>{{#if roadWidthMeters}}{{num roadWidthMeters}} m{{else}}N.A.{{/if}}</td></tr>
  <tr class="total"><td>Circle rate applied</td>
      <td class="num">&#8377; {{inr land.circleRate}} / Sq.m</td></tr>
</table>

{{!-- The label sits above rather than over the scan: this is a document, and
      an overlay would cover the very rows the rate was read from. --}}
{{#if circleRatePhoto}}
<h3 class="band">Extract from the Government Circle Rate Register</h3>
<div class="plate" style="height: {{circleRateHeightMm}}mm; margin-top: 0;">
  <img src="{{circleRatePhoto}}" alt="Extract from the government circle-rate register" />
</div>
{{else}}
<div class="placeholder" style="height: {{circleRateHeightMm}}mm; margin-top: 3mm;">
  No circle-rate extract uploaded yet.
</div>
{{/if}}
